    <projectnotes width="400" x="700" y="10" maximized="0" height="300" visible="0" minimized="0"><![CDATA[Desolatum - Cave level, enemy waves. E minor, 140 BPM, 64 bars; same chords and length as calm, so the two can crossfade in sync. Master Bitcrush 16 kHz / 8-bit / 75% wet, then a Fast Lookahead Limiter (+12 dB in, -0.5 dB ceiling). Loop markers cover the whole song; export with "Export between loop markers" for a seamless game loop.]]></projectnotes>
